{"format":"mandarin-paket","version":1,"id":"hsk-h3-11","typ":"text","titel":"生日礼物 · Ein Geburtstagsgeschenk","thema":"HSK 3","beschreibung":"Lesetext HSK 3, 15 Sätze.","saetze":[{"nr":1,"w":[["下","Xià"],["个","ge"],["星期","xīng qī"],["是","shì"],["我","wǒ"],["妻子","qī zi"],["的","de"],["生日","shēng rì"],["，"],["我","wǒ"],["一直","yì zhí"],["在","zài"],["想","xiǎng"],["送","sòng"],["她","tā"],["什么","shén me"],["礼物","lǐ wù"],["。"]],"de":"Nächste Woche hat meine Frau Geburtstag, und ich überlege die ganze Zeit, was ich ihr schenken soll.","audio":"audio/01.mp3","langsam":"audio/01-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":2,"w":[["去年","Qù nián"],["我","wǒ"],["送","sòng"],["了","le"],["她","tā"],["一","yí"],["块","kuài"],["手表","shǒu biǎo"],["，"],["以前","yǐ qián"],["还","hái"],["送","sòng"],["过","guò"],["一","yì"],["条","tiáo"],["裙子","qún zi"],["。"]],"de":"Letztes Jahr schenkte ich ihr eine Uhr, früher auch schon einen Rock.","audio":"audio/02.mp3","langsam":"audio/02-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":3,"w":[["今年","Jīn nián"],["我","wǒ"],["想","xiǎng"],["送","sòng"],["一","yí"],["个","ge"],["特别","tè bié"],["的","de"],["礼物","lǐ wù"],["。"]],"de":"Dieses Jahr möchte ich etwas Besonderes schenken.","audio":"audio/03.mp3","langsam":"audio/03-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":4,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["问","wèn"],["我","wǒ"],["的","de"],["女儿","nǚér"],["："],["“"],["你","nǐ"],["觉得","jué de"],["妈妈","mā ma"],["最","zuì"],["需要","xū yào"],["什么","shén me"],["？"],["”"]],"de":"Ich fragte meine Tochter: «Was braucht Mama deiner Meinung nach am meisten?»","audio":"audio/04.mp3","langsam":"audio/04-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":5,"w":[["女儿","Nǚér"],["想","xiǎng"],["了","le"],["一会儿","yí huìr"],["，"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["妈妈","mā ma"],["工作","gōng zuò"],["太","tài"],["忙","máng"],["了","le"],["，"],["她","tā"],["需要","xū yào"],["休息","xiū xi"],["。"],["”"]],"de":"Sie überlegte kurz und sagte: «Mama arbeitet zu viel, sie braucht Erholung.»","audio":"audio/05.mp3","langsam":"audio/05-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":6,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["觉得","jué de"],["她","tā"],["说","shuō"],["得","de"],["很","hěn"],["对","duì"],["。"]],"de":"Ich fand, sie hatte völlig recht.","audio":"audio/06.mp3","langsam":"audio/06-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":7,"w":[["所以","Suǒ yǐ"],["我","wǒ"],["决定","jué dìng"],["，"],["周末","zhōu mò"],["带","dài"],["妻子","qī zi"],["去","qù"],["一","yí"],["个","ge"],["安静","ān jìng"],["的","de"],["地方","dì fang"],["旅游","lǚ yóu"],["两","liǎng"],["天","tiān"],["。"]],"de":"Darum beschloss ich, mit meiner Frau übers Wochenende an einen ruhigen Ort zu reisen.","audio":"audio/07.mp3","langsam":"audio/07-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":8,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["上网","shàng wǎng"],["找","zhǎo"],["了","le"],["一","yí"],["个","ge"],["宾馆","bīn guǎn"],["，"],["宾馆","bīn guǎn"],["旁边","páng biān"],["有","yǒu"],["一","yì"],["条","tiáo"],["河","hé"],["，"],["环境","huán jìng"],["非常","fēi cháng"],["好","hǎo"],["。"]],"de":"Ich fand im Internet ein Hotel an einem Fluss, in einer sehr schönen Umgebung.","audio":"audio/08.mp3","langsam":"audio/08-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":9,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["还","hái"],["跟","gēn"],["女儿","nǚér"],["一起","yì qǐ"],["做","zuò"],["了","le"],["一","yí"],["个","ge"],["蛋糕","dàn gāo"],["。"]],"de":"Ausserdem backte ich mit meiner Tochter einen Kuchen.","audio":"audio/09.mp3","langsam":"audio/09-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":10,"w":[["这","Zhè"],["是","shì"],["我","wǒ"],["第一","dì yī"],["次","cì"],["做","zuò"],["蛋糕","dàn gāo"],["，"],["做","zuò"],["完","wán"],["以后","yǐ hòu"],["，"],["厨房","chú fáng"],["非常","fēi cháng"],["不","bù"],["干净","gān jìng"],["。"]],"de":"Es war mein erster Kuchen, und danach war die Küche ziemlich schmutzig.","audio":"audio/10.mp3","langsam":"audio/10-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":11,"w":[["生日","Shēng rì"],["那天","nà tiān"],["早上","zǎo shang"],["，"],["女儿","nǚér"],["把","bǎ"],["蛋糕","dàn gāo"],["拿","ná"],["给","gěi"],["妈妈","mā ma"],["，"],["大声","dà shēng"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["生日","shēng rì"],["快乐","kuài lè"],["！"],["”"]],"de":"Am Geburtstagsmorgen brachte meine Tochter Mama den Kuchen und rief: «Alles Gute zum Geburtstag!»","audio":"audio/11.mp3","langsam":"audio/11-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":12,"w":[["我","Wǒ"],["把","bǎ"],["宾馆","bīn guǎn"],["的","de"],["照片","zhào piàn"],["给","gěi"],["妻子","qī zi"],["看","kàn"],["，"],["告诉","gào su"],["她","tā"],["我们","wǒ men"],["周末","zhōu mò"],["要","yào"],["去","qù"],["旅游","lǚ yóu"],["。"]],"de":"Ich zeigte meiner Frau die Fotos vom Hotel und sagte ihr, dass wir am Wochenende verreisen.","audio":"audio/12.mp3","langsam":"audio/12-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":13,"w":[["妻子","Qī zi"],["先","xiān"],["是","shì"],["不","bù"],["明白","míng bai"],["，"],["然后","rán hòu"],["笑","xiào"],["了","le"],["。"]],"de":"Meine Frau verstand zuerst nicht, dann lachte sie.","audio":"audio/13.mp3","langsam":"audio/13-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":14,"w":[["她","Tā"],["说","shuō"],["："],["“"],["这","zhè"],["是","shì"],["我","wǒ"],["最","zuì"],["喜欢","xǐ huan"],["的","de"],["礼物","lǐ wù"],["！"],["”"]],"de":"Sie sagte: «Das ist das schönste Geschenk, das ich je bekommen habe!»","audio":"audio/14.mp3","langsam":"audio/14-langsam2.mp3"},{"nr":15,"w":[["虽然","Suī rán"],["蛋糕","dàn gāo"],["不","bú"],["太","tài"],["好看","hǎo kàn"],["，"],["但是","dàn shì"],["大家","dà jiā"],["都","dōu"],["说","shuō"],["很","hěn"],["好吃","hǎo chī"],["。"]],"de":"Der Kuchen sah zwar nicht so schön aus, aber alle fanden ihn lecker.","audio":"audio/15.mp3","langsam":"audio/15-langsam2.mp3"}],"woerter":{"下":{"py":"Xià","art":"Ortswort/V","de":"unten; nächst; herunterkommen","herl":"Strich unter der Grundlinie. 下个月 = nächsten Monat.","audio":"audio/w/1.mp3"},"个":{"py":"ge","art":"ZW","de":"allgemeines Zählwort","herl":"Steht zwischen Zahl/这/那 und Nomen: 三个人. Wird im Deutschen nicht übersetzt.","audio":"audio/w/2.mp3"},"星期":{"py":"xīng qī","art":"N","de":"Woche","herl":"星 Stern + 期 Zeitspanne. 下个星期 = nächste Woche.","audio":"audio/w/3.mp3"},"是":{"py":"shì","art":"V","de":"sein","herl":"日 Sonne über 正 richtig: ursprünglich «so ist es». Verbindet Nomen: 我是学生. Vor Adjektiven steht 很, nicht 是.","audio":"audio/w/4.mp3"},"我":{"py":"wǒ","art":"Pron","de":"ich","herl":"Ursprünglich Bild einer Hellebarde (Waffe 戈 mit gezackter Klinge). Wurde wegen des gleichen Lauts für «ich» entlehnt.","audio":"audio/w/5.mp3"},"妻子":{"py":"qī zi","art":"N","de":"Ehefrau","herl":"妻 Ehefrau + 子.","audio":"audio/w/6.mp3"},"的":{"py":"de","art":"Part","de":"Besitz- und Attributpartikel («-s», «von»)","herl":"白 weiss + 勺 Löffel; ursprünglich «hell, klar». Heute grammatisch: 我的 = mein, 好吃的菜 = feines Essen.","audio":"audio/w/7.mp3"},"生日":{"py":"shēng rì","art":"N","de":"Geburtstag","herl":"生 geboren + 日 Tag.","audio":"audio/w/8.mp3"},"一直":{"py":"yì zhí","art":"Adv","de":"die ganze Zeit; geradeaus","herl":"一 + 直 gerade.","audio":"audio/w/9.mp3"},"在":{"py":"zài","art":"V/Präp","de":"sich befinden; in, an; gerade (tun)","herl":"Ortsangabe steht vor dem Verb: 在学校工作. Vor Verben auch «gerade»: 我在看书.","audio":"audio/w/10.mp3"},"想":{"py":"xiǎng","art":"V/Hilfsverb","de":"möchten; denken; vermissen","herl":"相 (Lautteil) + 心 Herz. 我想你 = Ich vermisse dich.","audio":"audio/w/11.mp3"},"送":{"py":"sòng","art":"V","de":"schenken; bringen","herl":"辶 gehen + 关. 送给她 = ihr schenken.","audio":"audio/w/12.mp3"},"她":{"py":"tā","art":"Pron","de":"sie","herl":"女 Frau + 也 (Lautteil). Gleich ausgesprochen wie 他.","audio":"audio/w/13.mp3"},"什么":{"py":"shén me","art":"Fragewort","de":"was, welche","herl":"什 + 么 (Fragesuffix). 什么时候 = wann.","audio":"audio/w/14.mp3"},"礼物":{"py":"lǐ wù","art":"N","de":"Geschenk","herl":"礼 Ritual + 物 Ding.","audio":"audio/w/15.mp3"},"去年":{"py":"Qù nián","art":"N","de":"letztes Jahr","herl":"去 vergangen + 年 Jahr.","audio":"audio/w/16.mp3"},"了":{"py":"le","art":"Part","de":"(abgeschlossene Handlung, Veränderung)","herl":"Nach dem Verb: Handlung ist geschehen (我买了). Am Satzende: neue Lage (下雨了 = jetzt regnet es).","audio":"audio/w/17.mp3"},"一":{"py":"yí","art":"Zahl","de":"eins, ein","herl":"Ein Strich. Ton wechselt: vor 4. Ton yí (一个), sonst yì (一些), allein yī.","audio":"audio/w/18.mp3"},"块":{"py":"kuài","art":"ZW","de":"Yuan (mündlich); Stück","herl":"土 Erde + 夬 (Lautteil): ursprünglich Erdklumpen. 一块手表 = eine Uhr.","audio":"audio/w/19.mp3"},"手表":{"py":"shǒu biǎo","art":"N","de":"Armbanduhr","herl":"手 Hand + 表 Uhr.","audio":"audio/w/20.mp3"},"以前":{"py":"yǐ qián","art":"N","de":"früher, vorher","herl":"以 + 前 vorn. 来中国以前 = bevor ich nach China kam.","audio":"audio/w/21.mp3"},"还":{"py":"hái","art":"Adv","de":"noch; auch noch; ziemlich","herl":"还想去 = möchte noch einmal hin. Nicht zu verwechseln mit 还 huán «zurückgeben».","audio":"audio/w/22.mp3"},"过":{"py":"guò","art":"V/Part","de":"verbringen; vorbeigehen; (schon einmal getan)","herl":"过生日 = Geburtstag feiern. 送过 = schon einmal geschenkt.","audio":"audio/w/23.mp3"},"条":{"py":"tiáo","art":"ZW","de":"Zählwort für Langes (Rock, Fluss, Strasse)","herl":"一条河 = ein Fluss.","audio":"audio/w/24.mp3"},"裙子":{"py":"qún zi","art":"N","de":"Rock, Kleid","herl":"衤 Kleid + 君 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/25.mp3"},"今年":{"py":"Jīn nián","art":"N","de":"dieses Jahr","herl":"今 jetzt + 年 Jahr.","audio":"audio/w/26.mp3"},"特别":{"py":"tè bié","art":"Adv/Adj","de":"besonders","herl":"特 besonders + 别 anders.","audio":"audio/w/27.mp3"},"问":{"py":"wèn","art":"V","de":"fragen","herl":"门 Tür + 口 Mund: an der Tür fragen.","audio":"audio/w/28.mp3"},"女儿":{"py":"nǚér","art":"N","de":"Tochter","herl":"女 Frau + 儿 Kind.","audio":"audio/w/29.mp3"},"你":{"py":"nǐ","art":"Pron","de":"du","herl":"亻 Mensch + 尔 du (alte Form).","audio":"audio/w/30.mp3"},"觉得":{"py":"jué de","art":"V","de":"finden, meinen; sich fühlen","herl":"觉 empfinden + 得. 我觉得… = Ich finde…","audio":"audio/w/31.mp3"},"妈妈":{"py":"mā ma","art":"N","de":"Mutter, Mama","herl":"女 Frau + 马 (Lautteil mǎ).","audio":"audio/w/32.mp3"},"最":{"py":"zuì","art":"Adv","de":"am meisten","herl":"最喜欢 = am liebsten, 最好 = am besten.","audio":"audio/w/33.mp3"},"需要":{"py":"xū yào","art":"V","de":"brauchen","herl":"需 benötigen + 要 wollen.","audio":"audio/w/34.mp3"},"一会儿":{"py":"yí huìr","art":"N","de":"eine Weile, kurz","herl":"一 + 会 Moment + 儿.","audio":"audio/w/35.mp3"},"说":{"py":"shuō","art":"V","de":"sagen, sprechen","herl":"讠 Rede + 兑 (Lautteil). 说汉语 = Chinesisch sprechen.","audio":"audio/w/36.mp3"},"工作":{"py":"gōng zuò","art":"V/N","de":"arbeiten; Arbeit, Stelle","herl":"工 Arbeit + 作 machen.","audio":"audio/w/37.mp3"},"太":{"py":"tài","art":"Adv","de":"zu, allzu; sehr","herl":"太…了 = toll! oder zu viel: 太好了 = super, 太贵了 = zu teuer.","audio":"audio/w/38.mp3"},"忙":{"py":"máng","art":"Adj","de":"beschäftigt","herl":"忄 Herz + 亡 verloren: «das Herz verlieren».","audio":"audio/w/39.mp3"},"休息":{"py":"xiū xi","art":"V","de":"sich ausruhen","herl":"休 Mensch 亻 lehnt am Baum 木 + 息 Atem.","audio":"audio/w/40.mp3"},"得":{"py":"de","art":"Part","de":"(Art und Weise)","herl":"Nach dem Verb: 唱得很好 = singt sehr gut. Als 觉得 Teil von «finden».","audio":"audio/w/41.mp3"},"很":{"py":"hěn","art":"Adv","de":"sehr","herl":"Vor Adjektiven oft nur Bindeglied: 天气很好 = Das Wetter ist gut.","audio":"audio/w/42.mp3"},"对":{"py":"duì","art":"Präp/Adj","de":"für, gegenüber; richtig","herl":"对身体好 = gut für die Gesundheit. 对！ = Richtig!","audio":"audio/w/43.mp3"},"所以":{"py":"Suǒ yǐ","art":"Konj","de":"deshalb, also","herl":"Oft mit 因为: 因为…所以… = weil…, deshalb…","audio":"audio/w/44.mp3"},"决定":{"py":"jué dìng","art":"V/N","de":"beschliessen; Entscheidung","herl":"决 entscheiden + 定 festlegen.","audio":"audio/w/45.mp3"},"周末":{"py":"zhōu mò","art":"N","de":"Wochenende","herl":"周 Woche + 末 Ende.","audio":"audio/w/46.mp3"},"带":{"py":"dài","art":"V","de":"mitnehmen; bringen","herl":"Bild eines Gürtels mit Anhängern.","audio":"audio/w/47.mp3"},"去":{"py":"qù","art":"V","de":"gehen, hingehen, fahren nach","herl":"Bewegung vom Sprecher weg. Gegenteil: 来 kommen.","audio":"audio/w/48.mp3"},"安静":{"py":"ān jìng","art":"Adj","de":"ruhig, still","herl":"安 friedlich + 静 still.","audio":"audio/w/49.mp3"},"地方":{"py":"dì fang","art":"N","de":"Ort, Stelle","herl":"地 Boden + 方 Richtung.","audio":"audio/w/50.mp3"},"旅游":{"py":"lǚ yóu","art":"V","de":"reisen, Ferien machen","herl":"旅 Reise + 游 umherwandern.","audio":"audio/w/51.mp3"},"两":{"py":"liǎng","art":"Zahl","de":"zwei (vor Zählwörtern)","herl":"两个人 = zwei Personen. Beim Zählen: 二.","audio":"audio/w/52.mp3"},"天":{"py":"tiān","art":"N","de":"Tag; Himmel","herl":"Mensch 大 mit Strich darüber: der Himmel über dem Kopf.","audio":"audio/w/53.mp3"},"上网":{"py":"shàng wǎng","art":"V","de":"ins Internet gehen","herl":"上 hinauf + 网 Netz.","audio":"audio/w/54.mp3"},"找":{"py":"zhǎo","art":"V","de":"suchen","herl":"扌 Hand + 戈. 找到 = finden.","audio":"audio/w/55.mp3"},"宾馆":{"py":"bīn guǎn","art":"N","de":"Hotel","herl":"宾 Gast + 馆 Gebäude.","audio":"audio/w/56.mp3"},"旁边":{"py":"páng biān","art":"Ortswort","de":"neben, daneben","herl":"旁 Seite + 边 Rand.","audio":"audio/w/57.mp3"},"有":{"py":"yǒu","art":"V","de":"haben; es gibt","herl":"Hand 𠂇 hält ein Stück Fleisch (月 = 肉): etwas besitzen. Verneint mit 没: 没有.","audio":"audio/w/58.mp3"},"河":{"py":"hé","art":"N","de":"Fluss","herl":"氵 Wasser + 可 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/59.mp3"},"环境":{"py":"huán jìng","art":"N","de":"Umgebung; Umwelt","herl":"环 Ring + 境 Grenze.","audio":"audio/w/60.mp3"},"非常":{"py":"fēi cháng","art":"Adv","de":"sehr, äusserst","herl":"非 nicht + 常 gewöhnlich: «aussergewöhnlich».","audio":"audio/w/61.mp3"},"好":{"py":"hǎo","art":"Adj","de":"gut; gern, einverstanden","herl":"女 Frau + 子 Kind: Mutter mit Kind steht für «gut». Als Antwort: «Einverstanden!»","audio":"audio/w/62.mp3"},"跟":{"py":"gēn","art":"Präp","de":"mit","herl":"足 Fuss + 艮: ursprünglich «Ferse, folgen». 跟我说 = zu mir sagen.","audio":"audio/w/63.mp3"},"一起":{"py":"yì qǐ","art":"Adv","de":"zusammen","herl":"一 eins + 起 aufstehen: «gemeinsam».","audio":"audio/w/64.mp3"},"做":{"py":"zuò","art":"V","de":"machen, tun; kochen","herl":"亻 Mensch + 故 (Lautteil). 做菜 = kochen.","audio":"audio/w/65.mp3"},"蛋糕":{"py":"dàn gāo","art":"N","de":"Kuchen","herl":"蛋 Ei + 糕 Kuchen.","audio":"audio/w/66.mp3"},"这":{"py":"Zhè","art":"Pron","de":"dies, dieser","herl":"辶 gehen + 文 (Lautteil).","audio":"audio/w/67.mp3"},"第一":{"py":"dì yī","art":"Zahl","de":"erster","herl":"第 Ordnungspräfix + 一. 第二 = zweiter.","audio":"audio/w/68.mp3"},"次":{"py":"cì","art":"ZW","de":"Mal","herl":"第一次 = das erste Mal, 三次 = dreimal.","audio":"audio/w/69.mp3"},"完":{"py":"wán","art":"V","de":"fertig sein","herl":"宀 Dach + 元: vollständig. 吃完 = fertig gegessen.","audio":"audio/w/70.mp3"},"以后":{"py":"yǐ hòu","art":"N","de":"danach; später, künftig","herl":"以 + 后 hinten. 回家以后 = nach dem Heimkommen.","audio":"audio/w/71.mp3"},"厨房":{"py":"chú fáng","art":"N","de":"Küche","herl":"厨 Küche + 房 Raum.","audio":"audio/w/72.mp3"},"不":{"py":"bù","art":"Adv","de":"nicht","herl":"Ton wechselt: vor 4. Ton bú (不去), sonst bù.","audio":"audio/w/73.mp3"},"干净":{"py":"gān jìng","art":"Adj","de":"sauber","herl":"干 trocken + 净 rein.","audio":"audio/w/74.mp3"},"那天":{"py":"nà tiān","art":"N","de":"jener Tag","herl":"那 jenes + 天 Tag.","audio":"audio/w/75.mp3"},"早上":{"py":"zǎo shang","art":"N","de":"Morgen, früh am Morgen","herl":"早 früh + 上. 早上好 = guten Morgen.","audio":"audio/w/76.mp3"},"把":{"py":"bǎ","art":"Präp/ZW","de":"(Objekt vorangestellt); Zählwort für Griffiges","herl":"把护照给她 = ihr den Pass geben. 一把伞 = ein Schirm.","audio":"audio/w/77.mp3"},"拿":{"py":"ná","art":"V","de":"nehmen, holen, halten","herl":"合 zusammen + 手 Hand.","audio":"audio/w/78.mp3"},"给":{"py":"gěi","art":"V/Präp","de":"geben; für","herl":"纟 Faden + 合 (Lautteil). 给我 = mir; 给她做饭 = für sie kochen.","audio":"audio/w/79.mp3"},"大声":{"py":"dà shēng","art":"Adv","de":"laut","herl":"大 gross + 声 Stimme.","audio":"audio/w/80.mp3"},"快乐":{"py":"kuài lè","art":"Adj","de":"glücklich, fröhlich","herl":"快 schnell, froh + 乐 Freude. 生日快乐 = alles Gute zum Geburtstag.","audio":"audio/w/81.mp3"},"照片":{"py":"zhào piàn","art":"N","de":"Foto","herl":"照 abbilden + 片 Blatt.","audio":"audio/w/82.mp3"},"看":{"py":"kàn","art":"V","de":"sehen, schauen, lesen; besuchen","herl":"手 Hand über 目 Auge: die Hand schirmt die Augen ab. 看朋友 = Freunde besuchen.","audio":"audio/w/83.mp3"},"告诉":{"py":"gào su","art":"V","de":"mitteilen, sagen","herl":"告 melden + 诉 erzählen. 告诉我 = sag mir.","audio":"audio/w/8